      <title>对于特朗普的前调解人来说，从“老鼠”到和解的痛苦之路</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/06/us/politics/michael-cohen-donald-trump-interview.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[总统已经与他的前律师迈克尔·D·科恩(Michael D. Cohen)和解，后者曾反对他。但与特朗普的说法相反，科恩并没有撤销帮助他的前任老板定罪的证词。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/06/us/politics/michael-cohen-donald-trump-interview.html</guid>
