    <item>
      <title>德国针对极右翼的“防火墙”正在经受前所未有的考验</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/07/world/europe/germany-afd-election-saxony-anhalt-election.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[极右翼的德国另类选择党在州选举中大获全胜，这表明选民对于是否坚持数十年来排挤极端分子的策略存在分歧。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/07/world/europe/germany-afd-election-saxony-anhalt-election.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 07 Sep 2026 13:54:51 GMT</pubDate>
